//RS     /// Prints a reducible body as structured Rust (the Jet emitter's
//RS     /// `jet_rust_emit_cfg_run`): a dominator subtree is printed in place, a
//RS     /// loop header wraps its subtree in `'jet_loop_N: loop`, and a merge block
//RS     /// follows the labeled block `'jet_block_N` its predecessors break out of.
